# Sanctifiers themselves - so each sees the other enter (CR 603.6a, 603.2) and Bot1 gains 2 life. Put onto the battlefield
# one at a time, only the first would see the second. Bot1: 20, +1 as the second Sanctifier was cast, +2 = 23.
